  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Tonys_Fnaf_Pack/BH_TFP_Header.webp\" width=\"1120\" height=\"588\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>僅限 Java 版 Minecraft</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fADKR\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Tonys_Fnaf_Pack/BH_TFP_Promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"201\"></a>玩具熊的五夜驚魂（Five Nights at Freddy's）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;一個讓社群玩家趨之若鶩並深深著迷的恐怖獨立遊戲系列<br><br>隨著「玩具熊的五夜驚魂」的人氣攀升</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Minecraft 模組開始被大量製作，並逐漸受到矚目</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">吸引了眾多玩家的關注，因此我推出了這個整合包，讓你能在遊戲中實現各種想要的玩法</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">在機械玩偶環繞中倖存</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">建造屬於你自己的披薩店／餐廳</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">喜歡的話也可以進行角色扮演&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">與朋友一起遊玩</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Tonys_Fnaf_Pack/BH_TFP_Desc1.webp\" width=\"1119\" height=\"288\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Supplementaries</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Supplementaries 是一款高度可配置的 Forge 模組，專注於添加能彌補原版內容缺口的實用素材。其功能設計兼顧實用性、美觀性與既有內容的互補性，為你的原版 + 體驗提供多種全新的增強方式。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">The Five Nights at Freddy's Mod</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此模組將「玩具熊的五夜驚魂」的世界帶入 Minecraft，並加入前三代遊戲中的機械玩偶角色。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Security Craft</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">新增可透過平板電腦查看的監視攝影機</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">新增需使用鑰匙卡或密碼鍵盤開啟的鎖定門</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fADKR\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Tonys_Fnaf_Pack/BH_TFP_Promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>若想開伺服器與朋友一起玩，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fTHRN\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/THRN</a>&nbsp;，並</p>\n<p>輸入優惠碼 THRN&nbsp;即可享受首台伺服器 25% 折扣</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QenqTJNpcC\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Tonys_Fnaf_Pack/BH_TFP_Desc2.webp\" width=\"1131\" height=\"121\"></a><br><br><br>其他所有模組&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Additional Guns</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Carry On</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Comforts (Fabric/Forge/Quilt)</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Create Crafts &amp; Additions</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Create Deco</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Steam 'n' Rail</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Fazcraft [Minecraft x FNaF]</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">FNaF's UNIVERSE&amp;FANVERSE</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Jade 🔍</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Doors</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Fences and Walls</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Furniture</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Lights and Lamps</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Roofs</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Trapdoors</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Windows</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Mo' Guns</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Tweaks</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish's Furniture Mod</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish's Gun Mod</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Serene Seasons</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Light</a></p>\n<p>Static's Vintage Animatronics [FNaF x Pizza Time Theatre]</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;整合包相關影片</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7U4hLUYVB8w?wmode=transparent\" width=\"297\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bnKEg-8ucu0?t=160s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nX2LsoBHNfY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
